WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.675
Module two is getting the
library into production safely.

2
00:00:03.675 --> 00:00:06.461
A policy that targets
all users can lock out

3
00:00:06.461 --> 00:00:09.712
the whole organization,
administrators included.

4
00:00:09.712 --> 00:00:14.248
So this module covers the gates,
reading report-only and rolling back,

5
00:00:14.248 --> 00:00:18.910
governed exclusions, break-glass
accounts, and what the logs must show.
